---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
import { HOWTO, howtoHref } from "../data/nav.js";
const headings = HOWTO.map((g, i) => ({ slug: `g${i}`, text: g.group, depth: 2 }));
---
<Site title="How-to：具体怎么做" headings={headings}>
  <article class="xxd-prose">
    <h1>How-to：具体怎么做</h1>
    <p>一篇只讲一件事。主线教程讲的是「pstack 怎么想问题」，这里讲的是「我手上这件活，具体该怎么跟它说」。每篇都有能直接复制的提示词。</p>
    {HOWTO.map((g, i) => (
      <>
        <h2 id={`g${i}`}>{g.group}</h2>
        <ul class="xxd-list" data-interactive>
          {g.items.map((it) => <li class="xxd-list__item"><a class="xxd-list__main list-link" href={howtoHref(it.slug)}><span class="xxd-list__title">{it.title}</span></a></li>)}
        </ul>
      </>
    ))}
  </article>
</Site>
